# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/events/clubs.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@event duel_practice_bout
# en: Practice Bout
title [39d05a] = 练习对决
# en: Wednesday practice. The captain pairs you with a fourth-year who has a reputation for ending bouts quickly. "Defence or attack," the captain says. "Pick one and commit."
text [4d124e] = 周三的练习。社长把你和一个以速战速决出名的四年级生分在一组。“防守还是进攻，”社长说，“选一个，然后坚持到底。”
# en: A chalk circle on a stone floor under high windows, two students mid-duel, a ring of members cheering.
scene [d4da5e] = 高窗下石地板上的粉笔圈，两名学生正在对决，一圈社员在欢呼。
# en: Hold your ground
opt.left.label [52ce0a] = 坚守阵地
# en: You weather everything she throws until she runs out of breath. The captain nods slowly.
opt.left.say.1 [209cbc] = 你扛住了她的每一招，直到她气喘吁吁。社长缓缓点头。
# en: You hold your ground very bravely, right up until you're on the floor.
opt.left.say.2 [774fd6] = 你非常勇敢地坚守着阵地，一直坚守到躺在地上为止。
# en: Go on the attack
opt.right.label [0fc83d] = 主动进攻
# en: Your opening hex catches her off guard. Point to you. The circle whoops.
opt.right.say.1 [25eae8] = 你的开局恶咒打了她个措手不及。你得一分。社员们一片欢呼。
# en: She sidesteps and you hex the wall. The wall wins.
opt.right.say.2 [1d6bcd] = 她一个侧身，你的恶咒打在了墙上。墙赢了。
# en: Brace and let them come
opt.up.label [83a55a] = 坚守，让他们来
# en: You plant your feet and the fourth-year's whole attack breaks on you, each blow softer than the last, until they run out of ideas. The captain marks the bout a draw and looks at you for a long moment.
opt.up.say.1 [d280f1] = 你站稳脚跟，那个四年级生的整套攻势都在你身上碎开，一击比一击轻，直到对方没了招数。队长把这局记成平局，盯着你看了很久。

@event duel_bram_hazing
# en: Initiation, Prefect-Style
title [d6f56a] = 级长式入社仪式
# en: Bram Hollis, prefect and the Circle's loudest member, has decided new members need "toughening up". He's made you hold a shield-charm against him for an hour. The hour is not up.
text [1ad653] = 布拉姆·霍利斯——级长，也是决斗社里嗓门最大的一个——认定新人需要“磨练磨练”。他让你顶着他的攻击维持护盾咒一小时。一小时还没到。
# en: A burly student in a prefect's sash blocking a corridor, wand twirling, a crowd of members watching nervously.
scene [c5bf3b] = 一个身披级长绶带的魁梧学生堵在走廊里转着魔杖，一群社员紧张地围观。
# en: Endure it
opt.left.label [9e8205] = 忍下去
# en: Your arms shake. You don't drop the charm. Bram grunts, almost approvingly, and finds someone else to torment.
opt.left.say.1 [cda0fd] = 你的手臂在发抖。你没有放下护盾。布拉姆哼了一声，几乎带着赞许，转身去折磨别人了。
# en: Drop the shield and duel him
opt.right.label [df3e2f] = 撤掉护盾，和他决斗
# en: You disarm him in front of everyone. His wand clatters across the floor. The silence is delicious. He will remember this.
opt.right.say.1 [df1203] = 你当众缴了他的械。他的魔杖哐啷滚过地板。那份寂静美妙极了。他会记住这一刻的。
# en: Bram flattens you with a single bored flick. "Toughening up," he reminds the room.
opt.right.say.2 [675677] = 布拉姆百无聊赖地一挥杖就把你拍扁了。“磨练磨练。”他提醒全场。
# en: Brace and outlast him
opt.up.label [8f1af7] = 坚守，熬过他
# en: You brace, and the hour stops hurting. At the end Bram is out of breath and you are still standing. "Section nine," he mutters. "Unusual fortitude." He writes it down, which from Bram is a medal.
opt.up.say.1 [6dce0f] = 你一坚守，这一小时就不疼了。到最后布拉姆气喘吁吁，你还站着。“第九条，”他嘟囔着，“耐力异常。”他把它记了下来，这对布拉姆来说就是一枚勋章。

@event duel_lyra_training
# en: Training Partners
title [6e568e] = 训练搭档
# en: Lyra finds you after practice. "The tournament is in two months. You're the only person in this club who doesn't bore me. Train with me. Dawn. Every day. Don't be late."
text [7cf72d] = 练习结束后莱拉找到你。“锦标赛还有两个月。你是这个社里唯一不让我觉得无聊的人。跟我一起练。黎明。每天。别迟到。”
# en: A misty lawn at dawn, two figures practising wand forms side by side, frost on the grass.
scene [bd3dcc] = 黎明时雾气笼罩的草坪，两个身影并肩练习杖法，草上结着霜。
# en: Decline — you need sleep
opt.left.label [e4f9c1] = 拒绝——你需要睡觉
# en: "Sleep," she repeats, as if it's a foreign word. "Fine."
opt.left.say.1 [ceaa69] = “睡觉。”她重复了一遍，好像那是个外语词。“随你。”
# en: Agree
opt.right.label [362be3] = 答应
# en: She's a merciless coach. Somewhere around the third week, you notice she's started bringing two cups of tea.
opt.right.say.1 [28ecad] = 她是个毫不留情的教练。大约第三周，你发现她开始带两杯茶来了。
# en: Since she can't make toast, you bring it. She eats it at the edge of the training ground without a word, and the next morning there are two slices waiting for you.
opt.right.say.2 [2ee4e1] = 既然她不会烤吐司，你就带了吐司去。她在训练场边上一言不发地吃完，第二天早上，那儿已经有两片在等你了。
# en: Train at her fire, not her side
opt.up.label [12aa02] = 陪她烧火，不是陪她练
# en: You tell her you'll come at dawn, but to spar, not to drill. Lyra's eyes narrow, then light up. Every morning for a week you both let the fire run and come in scorched to breakfast.
opt.up.say.1 [bcee00] = 你告诉她你天亮会来，但是来对练，不是来操练。莱拉眯起眼睛，然后眼睛亮了。整整一周，每天早上你们俩都放开野火，带着一身焦痕去吃早饭。

@event choir_solo
# en: Solo Auditions
title [c9c57e] = 独唱选拔
# en: Auditions for the Midwinter solo. The choirmaster's eyebrows are famously hard to impress. Your throat is dry. Your hands are wet.
text [d9b167] = 仲冬独唱的选拔。合唱指挥的眉毛出了名的难以打动。你的喉咙发干。你的手心冒汗。
# en: A circular choir loft under a painted dome, a single student standing in a pool of light, the rest of the choir floating gently above their seats.
scene [8e9373] = 彩绘穹顶下的圆形唱诗台，一名学生独自站在一束光里，其余团员轻轻悬浮在座位上方。
# en: Stay in the back row
opt.left.label [1db21b] = 待在后排
# en: You harmonise from safety, and it's lovely. Somebody else gets the solo and cries with relief.
opt.left.say.1 [7b529b] = 你在安全的位置和声，很动听。别人拿到了独唱，如释重负地哭了。
# en: Audition
opt.right.label [41aa8e] = 参加选拔
# en: You hit the high note and the candles in the loft all flare at once. The choirmaster's eyebrows rise one millimetre. You got it.
opt.right.say.1 [93eca5] = 你唱上了高音，唱诗台上所有的蜡烛同时一亮。指挥的眉毛抬高了一毫米。你选上了。
# en: Your voice cracks on the high note and a candle goes out in protest.
opt.right.say.2 [dae132] = 你的高音破了，一支蜡烛抗议般地熄灭了。

@event choir_levitation
# en: Off-Key Altitude
title [8a0afa] = 跑调的海拔
# en: The Choir of the Spheres literally floats when it harmonises. You keep falling out of the air on the third verse. People are starting to notice the thumps.
text [8ceebd] = 天球合唱团唱和声时真的会飘起来。可你每唱到第三段就会从空中掉下来。大家开始注意到那一声声“咚”了。
# en: A choir hovering a few feet off the floor, all in harmony — except one singer, who has dropped back to the ground with a thump.
scene [282038] = 一支悬浮在离地几尺高处齐声合唱的合唱团——除了一名团员，他“咚”地掉回了地上。
# en: Mime the hard bits
opt.left.label [583519] = 难的地方假唱
# en: Nobody notices. You float serenely, mouthing words. It's a little bit like fraud.
opt.left.say.1 [018b6b] = 没人发现。你安详地飘着，只动嘴不出声。有点像诈骗。
# en: Practise every night
opt.right.label [c7a2c5] = 每晚加练
# en: A week of late nights and you float through the third verse like a feather. The choirmaster gives you a tiny nod.
opt.right.say.1 [56e1a4] = 熬了一周夜，你像羽毛一样飘过了第三段。指挥朝你极轻地点了点头。

@event choir_concert
# en: The Winter Concert
title [428813] = 冬季音乐会
# en: The winter concert. The great hall is packed. Somewhere in the audience, the Ledger's critic is sharpening her quill.
text [ba472a] = 冬季音乐会。大礼堂座无虚席。观众席某处，《纪事报》的乐评人正在削她的羽毛笔。
# en: The great hall at night, a floating choir lit by candles, the audience below with faces tilted up.
scene [229006] = 夜晚的大礼堂，一支烛光映照的悬浮合唱团，下方的观众仰着脸。
# en: Sing for the audience
opt.left.label [44bf70] = 为观众而唱
# en: You sing and the hall sways. The review calls the choir "unearthly". You cut it out and keep it.
opt.left.say.1 [0a05a2] = 你一开口，整个礼堂都随之摇曳。乐评称合唱团“不似人间”。你把它剪下来收好了。
# en: Sing for yourself
opt.right.label [bcd2d2] = 为自己而唱
# en: You close your eyes and forget anyone is listening. When you open them, you are higher than everyone else.
opt.right.say.1 [e5902a] = 你闭上眼，忘了有人在听。再睁开时，你飘得比所有人都高。

@event sky_tryouts
# en: Tryouts
title [066773] = 选拔赛
# en: Skyrace tryouts: three laps around the towers, through the hoops, without dying. The captain has a stopwatch and no visible sense of humour.
text [ad510d] = 天空竞速队选拔：绕塔三圈，穿过所有光环，别摔死。队长手里拿着秒表，脸上看不出任何幽默感。
# en: Brooms streaking around the towers, hoops of light hanging in the sky, a captain with a whistle on the battlements.
scene [465a53] = 飞帚绕着高塔疾驰，光环悬在空中，城垛上站着一个吹哨子的队长。
# en: Fly clean and steady
opt.left.label [596f30] = 飞得干净稳当
# en: You're not the fastest, but you hit every hoop. "Reserve," says the captain. Then: "...no. Team."
opt.left.say.1 [a95632] = 你不是最快的，但每个光环都穿过了。“替补。”队长说。随即又改口：“……不。正式队员。”
# en: You miss two hoops and nearly a gargoyle. "Reserves," says the captain. "Keep practising."
opt.left.say.2 [35b3d5] = 你漏了两个光环，还差点撞上一个石像鬼。“替补。”队长说，“继续练。”
# en: Go full speed
opt.right.label [58ac43] = 全速冲刺
# en: You scream through the hoops so fast the stopwatch has to be checked. You're on the team. Obviously.
opt.right.say.1 [c5ef95] = 你尖叫着冲过光环，快到队长得核对一下秒表。你入选了。毫无悬念。
# en: You go full speed into the north tower. The tower is fine.
opt.right.say.2 [c3625d] = 你全速冲进了北塔。塔没事。
# en: Surge round the towers
opt.up.label [6da9bc] = 顺风绕塔疾飞
# en: The wind gets behind you on the first lap and you never let it go. Three laps, every hoop, faster each time, and your hands are raw on the handle. The captain looks at the stopwatch, then at you, and writes your name down.
opt.up.say.1 [c50191] = 第一圈风就绕到了你身后，你再也没让它走。三圈，每个圈环，一圈比一圈快，你的手在扫帚柄上磨破了。队长看看秒表，又看看你，写下了你的名字。

@event sky_crash
# en: A Bad Landing
title [cc3b0c] = 糟糕的着陆
# en: Practice. A gust catches you mid-turn, and the ground arrives rather sooner than expected. Your ankle is making an interesting shape.
text [ff2751] = 训练中。一阵风在你转弯时把你掀翻，地面来得比预想的要早一些。你的脚踝正呈现出一种有趣的形状。
# en: A broom snapped in two on the grass, a student sitting up dazed, teammates landing around them.
scene [6a9e37] = 草地上一把折成两截的飞帚，一个学生晕乎乎地坐起来，队友们在周围降落。
# en: Walk it off
opt.left.label [0e45b4] = 走两步就好了
# en: You do not walk it off. You limp it off, for a month.
opt.left.say.1 [4fdb76] = 并没有好。你一瘸一拐了一个月。
# en: Tough as old boots. The team cheers when you get back on your broom.
opt.left.say.2 [f9f523] = 皮实得很。你重新骑上飞帚时，全队都在欢呼。
# en: Straight to the infirmary
opt.right.label [510ab8] = 直奔医务室
# en: Sister Amaranth sets it in a minute and charges you three crowns for "carelessness". Fair.
opt.right.say.1 [7345b6] = 阿玛兰斯修女一分钟就把它接好了，还收了你三克朗的“粗心费”。公道。

@event sky_championship
# en: Lumenhold vs. Thornwick
title [da4be7] = 流明堡对荆木学院
# en: The championship against Thornwick Academy. Final lap. You're neck and neck with their captain, and the golden hoop is at the top of the tallest tower.
text [bd74b2] = 与荆木学院的冠军赛。最后一圈。你和对方队长并驾齐驱，金色光环就在最高塔的塔顶。
# en: Two teams of broom-riders in blue and green above a packed stadium, the golden finishing hoop glowing at the top of the highest tower.
scene [d82217] = 座无虚席的赛场上空，蓝绿两队飞帚手交错，金色终点光环在最高塔顶闪耀。
# en: Play it safe
opt.left.label [882711] = 稳妥起见
# en: Thornwick takes the hoop by a whisker. Still: second place in the region. The team carries you off the field anyway.
opt.left.say.1 [68b920] = 荆木以毫厘之差夺得光环。但不管怎样：地区亚军。全队还是把你扛出了场。
# en: The suicide dive
opt.right.label [494b9a] = 玩命俯冲
# en: You dive straight down the tower face and pull up at the last second, through the hoop. The stadium explodes.
opt.right.say.1 [742576] = 你沿着塔壁垂直俯冲，在最后一秒拉起，穿过光环。全场沸腾了。
# en: You dive. You miss. The crowd gasps, then cheers you anyway when you stagger up waving.
opt.right.say.2 [c58127] = 你俯冲了。你没穿中。观众倒吸一口凉气，等你踉跄着爬起来挥手时，又为你欢呼起来。

@event ledger_pie_scoop
# en: The Case of the Missing Pies
title [269d69] = 馅饼失踪案
# en: Nessa slams a file on your desk. "Pies. Forty-two of them, gone from the kitchens in a single night. I want the culprit, I want a photo and I want it by Friday."
text [bcd7f3] = 内莎把一份卷宗拍在你桌上。“馅饼。四十二个，一夜之间从厨房消失。我要找出犯人，要照片，周五之前要。”
# en: A cramped newspaper office in a tower attic, a printing press clanking, a girl with an ink-stained grin pointing at a map pinned with string.
scene [6fc23f] = 塔楼阁楼里拥挤的报社，印刷机哐当作响，一个满脸墨迹、咧嘴笑的女孩指着一张钉满细绳的地图。
# en: Write a light-hearted piece
opt.left.label [ffe459] = 写篇轻松的小文
# en: "Pie-rates Strike Again." Nessa groans at the headline and prints it anyway.
opt.left.say.1 [0a7002] = 《馅饼大盗再度出手》。内莎对着标题哀叹了一声，还是印了。
# en: Actually investigate
opt.right.label [42eb33] = 认真调查
# en: The culprit: a family of brownies living in the chimney. Your story runs on the front page. Nessa frames it.
opt.right.say.1 [5dd8ed] = 犯人：住在烟囱里的一窝棕仙。你的报道登上了头版。内莎把它裱了起来。
# en: You stake out the kitchens for three nights and catch nothing but a cold. Nessa pats your head.
opt.right.say.2 [6e3684] = 你在厨房蹲守了三晚，除了感冒什么也没逮到。内莎拍了拍你的头。
# en: Scribble every alibi down
opt.up.label [9c4bc5] = 把每份不在场证明记下
# en: Your quill takes down every alibi in the kitchens word for word. Laid side by side, two of them describe the same pie differently. Nessa reads your notes and goes very quiet, which means it's good.
opt.up.say.1 [cb08c8] = 你的羽毛笔把厨房里每个人的不在场证明一字不落地记下。并排一放，有两份对同一个馅饼的描述不一样。内莎读完你的笔记，安静了好一会儿——这说明东西不错。

@event ledger_bram_story
# en: The Prefect's Bribes
title [609034] = 级长的贿赂
# en: An anonymous tip: Bram Hollis has been taking bribes from first-years to skip their demerits. You have a witness. Nessa wants your byline on it. "This is real journalism," she says, eyes shining.
text [78f450] = 一条匿名线报：布拉姆·霍利斯一直在收一年级生的贿赂，帮他们免掉记过。你有目击证人。内莎想让这篇报道署你的名字。“这才是真正的新闻，”她说，眼睛闪闪发亮。
# en: An anonymous note spread on a desk under a lamp, next to a sketch of a prefect taking a coin purse from a first-year.
scene [b9aaf0] = 台灯下摊开的一张匿名字条，旁边是一幅速写：一名级长正从一年级生手里接过钱袋。
# en: Kill the story
opt.left.label [50cd1f] = 压下这篇报道
# en: Nessa is disappointed in you. Somehow, Bram finds out you buried it. He nods at you in the corridor. You feel slightly dirty.
opt.left.say.1 [307410] = 内莎对你很失望。不知怎么的，布拉姆知道是你压下了它。他在走廊里朝你点点头。你觉得自己有点脏。
# en: Publish it
opt.right.label [d859b5] = 发表它
# en: The story runs. Bram is stripped of his sash for a month. He gets it back. And now he knows exactly who you are.
opt.right.say.1 [017011] = 报道刊出了。布拉姆被摘掉绶带一个月。后来他又拿回去了。而现在，他非常清楚你是谁。
# en: Take the witness down word for word
opt.up.label [c2ae93] = 把证人的话逐字记下
# en: Your quill takes the witness down word for word, every hesitation included, and the story runs on what was said and nothing more. Bram can't deny a word of it. He tries, at length, in the corridor.
opt.up.say.1 [de7e2f] = 你的羽毛笔把证人的话逐字记下，连每次迟疑都记了，报道只登说过的话，一句不多。布拉姆一个字也赖不掉。他在走廊里试着赖了很久。

@event ledger_deadline
# en: Deadline Night
title [d06cb7] = 截稿之夜
# en: The press runs at dawn and half the paper is blank. Nessa is chewing her quill. "I need you tonight. All night. I'll owe you."
text [75d368] = 印刷机天亮开印，报纸还空着一半。内莎咬着羽毛笔。“今晚我需要你。整晚。我欠你一个人情。”
# en: The newspaper office at 3am, crumpled drafts on the floor, two students slumped over typesetting trays.
scene [4bbe74] = 凌晨三点的报社，地上满是揉皱的草稿，两个学生趴在排字盘上。
# en: Say you have revision to do
opt.left.label [12b3be] = 说你还要复习
# en: You sleep. The paper comes out with a large drawing of a duck on page four. Nessa doesn't speak to you for a day.
opt.left.say.1 [f578ae] = 你去睡了。报纸第四版上印了一幅巨大的鸭子画。内莎一整天没理你。
# en: Pull an all-nighter
opt.right.label [d42cd2] = 熬个通宵
# en: You write three articles and a horoscope. At dawn Nessa falls asleep on your shoulder, ink on her nose.
opt.right.say.1 [99e236] = 你写了三篇文章和一份星座运势。天亮时，内莎靠在你肩上睡着了，鼻尖上沾着墨水。
# en: You keep an eye on her quill all night, too, and twice catch it inventing a fire in the east wing. The paper is, for once, entirely true.
opt.right.say.2 [f03a3c] = 你整晚还盯着她的羽毛笔，两次逮到它在编造东翼起火的新闻。这一期报纸破天荒地句句属实。

@event garden_mandrakes
# en: The Mandrake Choir
title [a16982] = 曼德拉草合唱团
# en: The greenhouse mandrakes have started singing again. Off-key and enthusiastic. The earmuffs are on the hook by the door. Tobias isn't wearing his; he's harmonising.
text [df724d] = 温室里的曼德拉草又开始唱歌了。跑调，但热情洋溢。耳罩挂在门边的钩子上。托比亚斯没戴他的；他在跟着和声。
# en: Rows of potted mandrakes in a steamy greenhouse, their little leafy heads opened in song.
scene [65b35a] = 雾气蒸腾的温室里一排排盆栽曼德拉草，它们长着叶子的小脑袋张嘴高歌。
# en: Earmuffs on
opt.left.label [1586df] = 戴上耳罩
# en: You repot six mandrakes in blissful silence. Good honest work.
opt.left.say.1 [652505] = 你在幸福的寂静中给六株曼德拉草换了盆。踏踏实实的好活儿。
# en: Sing along
opt.right.label [91a84f] = 跟着唱
# en: You sing along and promptly faint. Mandrake song is strong stuff. You wake up very relaxed.
opt.right.say.1 [5d48fe] = 你跟着唱，然后立刻晕了过去。曼德拉草的歌声劲儿很大。你醒来时非常放松。
# en: The mandrakes adore you. The greenhouse sounds like a pub at closing time.
opt.right.say.2 [acd59a] = 曼德拉草们爱死你了。温室里听起来像打烊时的酒馆。

@event garden_moonflower
# en: The Moonflower
title [924066] = 月光花
# en: "The moonflower's going to bloom tonight," Tobias says, a little breathless. "Once every eleven years. I'm staying up to see it. You... could stay too. If you want."
text [1d0b11] = “今晚月光花要开了，”托比亚斯有点喘不过气地说，“十一年才开一次。我要熬夜看。你……也可以留下。如果你想的话。”
# en: A single silver flower opening in the dark of a glass greenhouse, two faces lit by its glow.
scene [ada882] = 漆黑的玻璃温室里一朵银色的花正在绽放，两张脸被它的光芒照亮。
# en: You need sleep
opt.left.label [145c0b] = 你得睡觉了
# en: "Course. Yeah." He tells you about it at breakfast, in detail, with gestures.
opt.left.say.1 [a1e34d] = “当然。嗯。”早饭时他给你讲了一遍，事无巨细，手舞足蹈。
# en: Stay up with him
opt.right.label [4a8ffd] = 陪他熬夜
# en: At 2am the flower opens and fills the greenhouse with silver light. Tobias doesn't look at the flower. He looks at you.
opt.right.say.1 [7c8d48] = 凌晨两点，花开了，银光洒满温室。托比亚斯没有看花。他在看你。
# en: Grow a hedge against the wind
opt.up.label [c446da] = 种道树篱挡风
# en: You stay, and when the wind gets up you grow a thorny screen round the bed. The moonflower opens at midnight in perfect stillness. Tobias doesn't say anything for a long time. Then he says, "Thank you," and means all of it.
opt.up.say.1 [0e023f] = 你留了下来，风起时你在花床周围长出一道带刺的屏障。午夜，月光花在一片静止中开了。托比亚斯很久什么也没说。然后他说：“谢谢你。”每个字都是真心的。

@event garden_maud_secret
# en: The Secret Garden
title [2193f1] = 秘密花园
# en: The old groundskeeper beckons you behind the potting shed, to a door in the wall you've walked past a hundred times without seeing. "You've got the hands for it," Old Maud says. "Want to see what grows where nobody's looking?"
text [e9e7ee] = 老园丁招手让你到盆栽棚后面，那里墙上有一扇门，你路过了上百次都没看见。“你有这双手，”老莫德说，“想看看在没人注意的地方长着什么吗？”
# en: An old woman in a battered straw hat holding open a hidden door in an ivy-covered wall; beyond, impossible flowers glow.
scene [044583] = 一位戴破草帽的老妇人推开爬满常春藤的墙上一扇隐秘的门；门后，不可思议的花朵闪着光。
# en: Thank her and decline
opt.left.label [4d277b] = 谢过她，婉拒了
# en: "Suit yourself." The door is gone when you look back. You make your class with a minute to spare, oddly pleased with yourself.
opt.left.say.1 [68610a] = “随你。”你回头时，那扇门已经不见了。你赶在上课前一分钟进了教室，莫名地有点得意。
# en: Follow her in
opt.right.label [499306] = 跟她进去
# en: Inside: glowing ferns, silver bees, a pear tree that hums. Maud tucks a sprig of rosemary into your pocket. "For luck. Don't lose it." You lose the whole afternoon in there, and a class with it.
opt.right.say.1 [9b2aee] = 里面有发光的蕨类、银色的蜜蜂，还有一棵会哼歌的梨树。莫德把一枝迷迭香塞进你口袋。“保佑你的。别弄丢了。”你在里面待掉了整个下午，还错过了一节课。

@event stars_cocoa_night
# en: Cocoa on the Roof
title [a1a0e0] = 屋顶上的热可可
# en: Stargazers meet on the roof with blankets, telescopes and an illegal quantity of cocoa. Tonight is cloudy. Nobody cares.
text [9a36b4] = 观星社在屋顶聚会，带着毯子、望远镜和数量不太合法的热可可。今晚多云。没人在乎。
# en: Students wrapped in blankets on a flat roof, steaming mugs in hand, telescopes pointed at a velvet sky.
scene [c74695] = 学生们裹着毯子坐在平坦的屋顶上，手捧冒热气的杯子，望远镜对着天鹅绒般的夜空。
# en: Talk until dawn
opt.left.label [2f64c7] = 聊到天亮
# en: You talk about home, about the future, about whether stars are lonely. Someone falls asleep on your shoulder.
opt.left.say.1 [6965e5] = 你们聊家乡，聊未来，聊星星会不会孤单。有人靠在你肩上睡着了。
# en: Do your homework by starlight
opt.right.label [5cf04c] = 借着星光写作业
# en: You finish your essay by the light of the cocoa-warmer charm. Productive. A little lonely.
opt.right.say.1 [6dcd21] = 你借着暖可可咒的光写完了论文。很高效。有点孤单。

@event stars_meteor_bet
# en: The Meteor Wager
title [262c9e] = 流星赌局
# en: The club is running a betting pool on tonight's meteor count. The current favourite is 40. The charts suggest something else. Or do they?
text [25d6ed] = 社团在为今晚的流星数量开赌盘。目前热门是 40 颗。星图暗示的数字却不一样。真的吗？
# en: A chalkboard on an observatory wall covered in tally marks and names, a pile of coins on a stool beneath it.
scene [e0c74a] = 天文台墙上的黑板写满计数和名字，下面凳子上堆着一堆硬币。
# en: Bet on the charts
opt.left.label [b8316b] = 押星图的数字
# en: Fifty-three meteors. You called fifty-two. Close enough to win the pot.
opt.left.say.1 [0a5d53] = 五十三颗流星。你押的是五十二。足够接近，赢下了奖池。
# en: The charts were wrong, or you read them wrong. Eight crowns gone.
opt.left.say.2 [bd7c8a] = 星图错了，或者是你看错了。八克朗没了。
# en: Stay out of it
opt.right.label [03d24a] = 不参与
# en: You watch the meteors for their own sake. Turns out that's the best seat in the house.
opt.right.say.1 [8c78f1] = 你只是单纯地看流星。原来这才是最好的位置。
# en: Recall the old meteor charts
opt.up.label [1fe4c7] = 调出旧流星图
# en: The observatory's oldest chart book falls open at this exact night a century ago: sixty-one meteors. You bet on sixty. You win, and the club demands to know what you know. You don't tell them.
opt.up.say.1 [ff8674] = 观星台最老的星图册翻开在一百年前的今夜：六十一颗流星。你押了六十。你赢了，社员们追问你知道些什么。你没告诉他们。

@event stars_constellation
# en: An Unnamed Shape
title [42283b] = 无名之形
# en: Plotting the autumn sky, you notice seven faint stars that form a ring around nothing. The charts call that patch of sky "empty". It doesn't look empty.
text [541d68] = 绘制秋季星空时，你注意到七颗暗淡的星星围成一个环，环中空无一物。星图把那片天空标为“空白”。可它看起来并不空。
# en: A star chart spread on a table, a student's finger tracing a new pattern between unmarked stars.
scene [cb6cc5] = 桌上摊开的星图，一名学生的手指在未标注的星星间描出新的图案。
# en: Ignore it
opt.left.label [e2ae0c] = 不去管它
# en: You plot the usual constellations. Your chart gets top marks.
opt.left.say.1 [9e48fd] = 你画了常规的星座。你的星图得了最高分。
# en: Investigate
opt.right.label [c3e054] = 调查一下
# en: You spend a week in the archives. Three hundred years ago, the patch was called the Hollow. Then someone scraped the name off every chart.
opt.right.say.1 [81c647] = 你在档案馆泡了一周。三百年前，那片天空叫作“空洞”。后来有人把这个名字从每一张星图上刮掉了。

@event carto_invite
# en: An Invitation at Midnight
title [324f7e] = 午夜邀请
# en: A black card under your door. On it, a map in silver ink that redraws itself while you watch. Corvin's handwriting: "Midnight. Under the third gargoyle. Bring a candle. Tell no one."
text [afdfc2] = 门缝下塞进一张黑色卡片。上面是一张银墨地图，在你眼前不断重绘。科尔文的笔迹：“午夜。第三尊石像鬼下面。带上蜡烛。别告诉任何人。”
# en: A slip of black paper pushed under a dormitory door, a silver ink map on it that rearranges itself as you watch.
scene [f40da5] = 一张从宿舍门缝塞进来的黑纸条，上面的银墨地图在你注视下自行重组。
# en: Ignore it
opt.left.label [e2ae0c] = 不理它
# en: The card blanks itself the next morning. Corvin doesn't mention it, but he's a little cooler for a week.
opt.left.say.1 [e32163] = 第二天早上卡片变成了空白。科尔文没提这事，但接下来一周对你冷淡了些。
# en: Go
opt.right.label [d0c56b] = 去
# en: Under the gargoyle: six students, a stack of maps and a passage you'd never seen. "Welcome," says Corvin, "to the club that doesn't exist."
opt.right.say.1 [de031b] = 石像鬼下面：六个学生、一摞地图，还有一条你从未见过的通道。“欢迎，”科尔文说，“来到这个不存在的社团。”

@event carto_thursday_stairs
# en: The Thursday Staircase
title [571623] = 周四楼梯
# en: The Cartographers have heard of a staircase that only exists on Thursdays between midnight and one. Tonight is Thursday. It is 11:58.
text [95afb9] = 制图社听说有一道楼梯，只在周四午夜到一点之间存在。今晚是周四。现在是 11:58。
# en: A spiral staircase emerging from a blank wall in moonlight, its steps unfolding one by one.
scene [54fe61] = 月光下一道螺旋楼梯从空白的墙面里冒出来，台阶一级一级地展开。
# en: Map it carefully
opt.left.label [150195] = 仔细绘制它
# en: You chart forty-one steps and a landing with a window onto a sky that isn't this one. The map is the club's pride.
opt.left.say.1 [0210dc] = 你画下了四十一级台阶，和一个平台——平台的窗外是另一片天空。这张地图成了社团的骄傲。
# en: Climb it to the top
opt.right.label [fb1da8] = 一直爬到顶
# en: At the top, a forgotten storeroom. Inside: a chest of old academy coins. The club splits it. Corvin cries a little.
opt.right.say.1 [13aaa2] = 顶上是一间被遗忘的储藏室。里面有一箱古老的学院硬币。社团把它分了。科尔文哭了一小会儿。
# en: At one o'clock the staircase stops existing. You were on it. You land in a laundry chute.
opt.right.say.2 [714828] = 一点整，楼梯不再存在。而你正站在上面。你掉进了洗衣房的滑道。

@event carto_lake_tunnel
# en: The Tunnel Under the Lake
title [7b054e] = 湖底隧道
# en: A loose stone in the boathouse cellar opens on a tunnel running out under the lake. The bricks drip. At the far end, a round door carved with a black star. It is warm to the touch.
text [ea3eb1] = 船屋地窖里一块松动的石头后面，是一条延伸到湖底的隧道。砖墙滴着水。尽头是一扇刻着黑色星星的圆门。摸上去是温的。
# en: A narrow brick tunnel dripping with water, lit by a single candle, ending at a round door carved with a black star.
scene [1d60a2] = 一条滴水的狭窄砖砌隧道，只有一支蜡烛照明，尽头是一扇刻着黑星的圆门。
# en: Mark it and leave
opt.left.label [98295f] = 做个标记就离开
# en: You add the tunnel to the club map with a skull beside it. Corvin adds a second skull, to be safe.
opt.left.say.1 [837f6b] = 你把隧道添到社团地图上，旁边画了个骷髅。科尔文又加了一个骷髅，以防万一。
# en: Press your palm to the star
opt.right.label [f4d16b] = 把手掌按在星上
# en: The star drinks the warmth out of your hand. Behind the door, something very large shifts in its sleep.
opt.right.say.1 [d08b1b] = 星星吸走了你掌心的温度。门后，有什么非常庞大的东西在睡梦中翻了个身。
